    + `FEDEX`
    + `DHL`
    + `OTHER`
+ `carrierName` (string, optional) - Required when `carrier` is `OTHER`.
+ `trackingNumber` (string, required) 


## Api Shops Orders Ship Response (object)


### Properties
+ `ok` (boolean, required) 
+ `synced` (boolean, required) - Whether PayPal accepted the tracking number.


## Api Shops Photos Request (object)


### Properties
+ `photos` (array[string], required) - Photo ids, in order.


## Api Shops Refine Request (object)


### Properties
+ `instruction`: `Make it feel more premium` (string, required) 


## Api Shops Refine Response (object)


### Properties
+ `spec` (DesignSpec, required) - What Gemini designed. OneThing's templates render it; Gemini never writes HTML.


## Api Shops Response (object)


### Properties
+ `ok` (boolean, required) 
+ `slug` (string, required) - The shop's link name after this change.


